    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashbound Expanse is a fast-paced first-person shooter with light roguelike elements, throwing you into a thrilling, ever-changing combat world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Battle through shifting levels, defeat powerful enemies and epic bosses, and face surprises and dangers each round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Customize your playstyle with freely combinable active and passive skills. Every run unlocks new rewards\u2014grow stronger each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Easy to pick up, thrilling to master \u2014 intuitive for beginners, addictive for pros (\u0e07 \u2022\u0300_\u2022\u0301)\u0e07</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Strategic skill builds \u2014 mix and match abilities for endless tactical depth and fast-paced action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Round-based progression \u2014 new arenas, random events, and relentless pacing keep you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Stunning visuals \u2014 powered by a high-end engine for a truly immersive experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 Light roguelike, no grind or paywalls \u2014 jump in anytime for satisfying, bite-sized shooting fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The page is under construction..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
